cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Medellin VRO Catalogue"
message: "If you use this catalogue, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-10-19
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/seap-udea/MVROC"
abstract: >-
  Photometric and dynamical properties of 524 asteroids measured in the
  public Rubin First Look data. Each row is one asteroid and includes the
  provisional designation, the time span and number of measurements in each
  filter, the orbit at the first observation, mean absolute magnitudes,
  colors from a joint multiband light-curve fit, a rotation period chosen by
  a vote across filters, the parameters of that fit, two shape fits, a
  solar-normalized reflectance, and physical properties from the JPL
  Small-Body Database.
